Package: popdemo
Title: A Demo Package for R Development with Population Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Jingxin", "Zhang", , "zhjx_19@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a minimal example for learning R package development. Includes a sample dataset from China's 7th Census and simple functions to calculate dependency ratios and plot population pyramids. Designed solely for educational demonstration purposes.
